# Captures are large and machine-local, so the directory contents are ignored — but the
# critic's verdicts are the record of what bar this build was held to, and they were being
# discarded along with them. Rounds 1-3's judgements are already gone this way. Keep the
# JSON; leave the PNGs out. (Ignore the contents, not the directory: git cannot un-ignore a
# file inside an ignored directory.)
shots/*
!shots/review-*.json
